          "id": "efc15adc1ed6b8b54f47798c5f67378acb774573",
          "message": "refactor: data provider --> store (#19290)\n\nIt has been agreed\n[here](https://github.com/AztecProtocol/aztec-packages/pull/19125#discussion_r2657514698)\nto rename `*DataProvider` as `*Store` and also to rename\n`SenderAddressBook` as `SenderAddressBookStore`.\n\nDecided to go ahead and just do this change now as AI agents are able to\none-shot changes like this.\n\nWhat is nice that it aligns the naming of `KeyStore` with the rest.\nDidn't realized this until implementing this.\n\n## Note for reviewing\n\nThe diff is huge but all of it is only renaming so I think you can just\nquickly skim through it.",
